Third-party data notice

`leaderboard_clean.csv` is a cleaned and enriched derivative of the Hugging
Face dataset "open-llm-leaderboard/contents"
(https://huggingface.co/datasets/open-llm-leaderboard/contents), published by
the Open LLM Leaderboard team. The upstream benchmark results remain the work
of their original authors; the MIT license above covers the analysis, derived
columns, figures, report and interactive explorer in this repository. Each
model listed in the dataset is governed by its own license (see the `license`
column).
